Mom.

797
01:28:09,702 --> 01:28:11,036
Try calcium.

798
01:28:11,037 --> 01:28:13,038
He needs some calcium in his body.

799
01:28:13,039 --> 01:28:15,266
Let's continue CPR, please.

800
01:28:30,264 --> 01:28:32,832
Would you people stand back?

801
01:28:37,605 --> 01:28:39,957
Something's happening.

802
01:28:40,149 --> 01:28:42,567
- Ooh, they're going to die.
- Shut up, Greg.

803
01:28:42,568 --> 01:28:44,736
Something is definitely happening.

804
01:28:44,737 --> 01:28:47,072
- Anybody have any ideas?
- EKG's flat.

805
01:28:47,073 --> 01:28:50,222
- EKG's flat.
- Okay, I'm going to call it.

806
01:28:51,661 --> 01:28:53,411
- I think he's dead.
- No. I don't know.

807
01:28:53,412 --> 01:28:55,580
All right. I'm calling it.
What time do you have?

808
01:28:55,581 --> 01:28:56,915
1536.

809
01:28:56,916 --> 01:28:59,769
15 hours, 36 minutes.

810
01:28:59,919 --> 01:29:01,862
Okay.

811
01:29:01,921 --> 01:29:04,364
Let's pack him in ice.

812
01:29:04,590 --> 01:29:06,863
Let's leave.

813
01:30:12,742 --> 01:30:14,889
Is he dead, Mama?

814
01:30:15,494 --> 01:30:17,767
I think so, sweetheart.

815
01:30:17,788 --> 01:30:20,607
Can we wish for him to come back?

816
01:30:21,834 --> 01:30:23,627
Yeah.

817
01:30:23,628 --> 01:30:25,650
I wish.

818
01:30:26,005 --> 01:30:28,107
I wish, too.

819
01:30:37,099 --> 01:30:41,124
Come on, Gert. We'll wait for
Elliott in the front room.

820
01:30:42,688 --> 01:30:47,651
Cardiac arrest was terminated
at 1500 hours and 36 minutes.

821
01:30:47,652 --> 01:30:53,365
He received intravenous lidocaine,
intravenous epinephrine, a lidocaine drip,

822
01:30:53,366 --> 01:30:57,869
2.7% sodium-chloride solution,
catheters from the "A" line.

823
01:30:57,870 --> 01:31:02,332
And the intravenous line
should be sent for culture.

824
01:31:02,333 --> 01:31:08,380
He was monitored with
an EEG and an EKG.

825
01:31:08,381 --> 01:31:10,298
He was defibrillated...

826
01:31:10,299 --> 01:31:12,634
They're going to have
to take him away now.

827
01:31:12,635 --> 01:31:15,613
They're just gonna cut him all up.

828
01:31:17,556 --> 01:31:21,251
Would you like to spend
some time alone with him?

829
01:31:36,158 --> 01:31:39,511
Could we all step out
for a minute, please?

830
01:32:33,424 --> 01:32:36,322
Look at what they've done to you.

831
01:32:38,637 --> 01:32:40,659
I'm so sorry.

832
01:32:46,312 --> 01:32:48,505
You must be dead

833
01:32:50,191 --> 01:32:54,921
because I don't know how to feel.

834
01:32:57,990 --> 01:33:00,843
I can't feel anything anymore.

835
01:33:03,579 --> 01:33:06,432
You've gone someplace else now.

836
01:33:14,215 --> 01:33:17,113
I'll believe in you all my life.

837
01:33:18,344 --> 01:33:20,366
Every day.

838
01:33:24,683 --> 01:33:26,500
E.T.,

839
01:33:29,063 --> 01:33:31,210
I love you.

840
01:34:02,096 --> 01:34:04,448
Oh, my God.

841
01:34:10,604 --> 01:34:13,064
E.T. phone home.

842
01:34:13,065 --> 01:34:16,734
Home. Phone home.

843
01:34:16,735 --> 01:34:18,611
Phone home.

844
01:34:18,612 --> 01:34:20,697
Does this mean they're coming?

845
01:34:20,698 --> 01:34:22,720
Yes.

846
01:34:24,869 --> 01:34:27,912
E.T. phone home. E.T. phone home.

847
01:34:27,913 --> 01:34:29,372
Stay.

848
01:34:29,373 --> 01:34:31,249
Shut up.

849
01:34:31,250 --> 01:34:32,542
Phone.

850
01:34:32,543 --> 01:34:33,918
- Phone home.
- Quiet!

851
01:34:33,919 --> 01:34:35,753
Phone! Phone! Phone!

852
01:34:35,754 --> 01:34:37,839
Would you shut up?

853
01:34:37,840 --> 01:34:40,300
Phone home. E.T. phone home.

854
01:34:40,301 --> 01:34:43,261
E.T. phone home. E.T. phone home.

855
01:34:43,262 --> 01:34:44,888
E.T. phone home.

856
01:34:44,889 --> 01:34:46,264
Phone home.

857
01:34:46,265 --> 01:34:48,558
Phone home. Elliott.

858
01:34:48,559 --> 01:34:51,958
Elliott. Elliott. Elliott.

859
01:34:54,523 --> 01:34:56,591
Elliott?

860
01:35:05,159 --> 01:35:07,727
- Elliott?
- No.

861
01:35:08,120 --> 01:35:12,315
- Elliott, why don't you come with me?
- No. No.

862
01:35:13,292 --> 01:35:15,565
- It's all right.
- No, no.

863
01:35:18,214 --> 01:35:20,632
It'll be all right.

864
01:35:20,633 --> 01:35:23,452
Would you like the flowers?

865
01:35:26,805 --> 01:35:30,141
He's alive! He's alive!

866
01:35:43,906 --> 01:35:46,282
Are they gone, Mama?

867
01:35:46,283 --> 01:35:48,576
- Who's gone, honey?
- The boys.

868
01:35:48,577 --> 01:35:50,349
What boys?

869
01:35:50,371 --> 01:35:54,271
I'm supposed to give you
this note when they're gone.

870
01:35:55,668 --> 01:35:57,986
Give it to me now, Gertie.

871
01:36:04,969 --> 01:36:07,287
Oh, my God.

872
01:36:15,688 --> 01:36:18,165
Give me a hand with this.

873
01:36:25,656 --> 01:36:27,865
- Where's your mask?
- It's back here.

874
01:36:27,866 --> 01:36:30,389
- Well, get it on!
- I'm trying!

875
01:36:36,542 --> 01:36:39,190
Hey, who are you?

876
01:36:39,295 --> 01:36:41,522
I'm driving.

877
01:36:42,423 --> 01:36:44,090
Open the door, son.

878
01:36:44,091 --> 01:36:46,217
There's a guy out here.
What do I do?

879
01:36:46,218 --> 01:36:48,991
What are you waiting for? Let's go!

880
01:36:49,221 --> 01:36:51,389
Well, let's get out
of here, Michael!

881
01:36:51,390 --> 01:36:54,809
I've never driven forward before!

882
01:37:03,027 --> 01:37:06,070
Get the bikes. Meet us at the
playground at the top of the hill.

883
01:37:06,071 --> 01:37:07,923
Let's do it!

884
01:37:09,116 --> 01:37:12,845
Come on, Michael! Go, go, go!

885
01:37:27,926 --> 01:37:31,262
We're all gonna die, and they're
never gonna give me my license.

886
01:37:34,099 --> 01:37:37,810
- Where's the playground?
- It's near the preschool!

887
01:37:37,811 --> 01:37:40,421
- Where's that?
- I don't know streets.

888
01:37:40,422 --> 01:37:42,762
Mom always drives me.

889
01:37:42,983 --> 01:37:44,901
Son of a bitch.

890
01:38:10,344 --> 01:38:13,638
- Where are you going?
- To the spaceship.

891
01:38:13,639 --> 01:38:17,683
- Spaceship?
- To the spaceship to the moon.

892
01:38:17,684 --> 01:38:19,752
Quiet!

893
01:38:20,771 --> 01:38:22,668
Oh, my God.

894
01:38:23,023 --> 01:38:25,341
Stop the van!

895
01:38:28,487 --> 01:38:30,885
Don't pull them off!

896
01:38:43,919 --> 01:38:45,941
That did it!

897
01:39:33,719 --> 01:39:38,665
Okay. He's a man from outer space
and we're taking him to his spaceship.

898
01:39:38,724 --> 01:39:41,142
Well, can't he just beam up?

899
01:39:41,143 --> 01:39:43,416
This is reality, Greg.

900
01:39:45,397 --> 01:39:46,898
- Keep her back!
- No!

901
01:39:46,899 --> 01:39:50,818
- Hold her back!
- No guns! They're children!

902
01:39:50,819 --> 01:39:53,654
No! No! No!

903
01:39:53,655 --> 01:39:55,406
- Where are they?
- No!

904
01:39:55,407 --> 01:39:57,725
There's nobody here.

905
01:40:04,833 --> 01:40:06,250
Where are we going?

906
01:40:06,251 --> 01:40:08,169
To the forest!

907
01:40:10,923 --> 01:40:12,820
Follow me!

908
01:40:44,873 --> 01:40:47,225
We got them, at the
bottom of the hill.

909
01:41:02,849 --> 01:41:04,517
This is Unit 302.

910
01:41:04,518 --> 01:41:08,463
We've cut the kids off at the bottom
of the hill. Send backup units.

911
01:41:32,588 --> 01:41:34,338
Let's split up.

912
01:41:34,339 --> 01:41:35,940
Okay!

913
01:41:43,765 --> 01:41:45,958
Hang on!

914
01:42:06,079 --> 01:42:09,148
We made it! Oh, shit!

915
01:42:34,900 --> 01:42:37,343
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

916
01:42:48,538 --> 01:42:51,061
Tell me when it's over!

917
01:43:43,135 --> 01:43:44,736
Ah.

918
01:44:03,447 --> 01:44:05,344
Home.

919
01:44:52,537 --> 01:44:54,413
Stop the car, Mama!

920
01:44:54,414 --> 01:44:57,938
They're over there!
They're over there!

921
01:45:13,225 --> 01:45:16,795
I just wanted to say goodbye.

922
01:45:17,896 --> 01:45:20,339
He doesn't know goodbye.

923
01:45:22,192 --> 01:45:24,840
Be good.

924
01:45:25,904 --> 01:45:27,596
Yes.

925
01:45:41,837 --> 01:45:43,438
Ah.

926
01:45:55,058 --> 01:45:58,582
Thank you.

927
01:45:59,521 --> 01:46:01,668
You're welcome.

928
01:46:27,716 --> 01:46:29,408
Come.

929
01:46:33,346 --> 01:46:35,493
Stay.

930
01:46:45,734 --> 01:46:47,551
Ouch.

931
01:46:53,491 --> 01:46:55,593
Ouch.

932
01:48:06,439 --> 01:48:12,045
I'll be right here.

933
01:48:21,413 --> 01:48:23,105
Bye.

